              <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491338662_582256_131404"/>
              <body> the meaning of the relationship. This information is defined by reference data. The ReferenceData tab provides definitions of the Reference Data currently standardized for OccurrenceRelationship. </body>
            </ownedComment>
