        <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491290579_722176_95927" xmi:uuid="9d948086-1938-4e9c-bebc-f14c371bf5f5" xmi:type="uml:Class">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491336466_846112_130227" xmi:uuid="49ff060e-cfd4-4b7a-a7ae-ae1f7ea86945" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491290579_722176_95927"/>
            <body>A NextAssemblyOccurrenceUsage is a type of AssemblyOccurrenceRelationship that is a relationship where the attribute Related specifies an occurrence of a constituent of an assembly and the attribute Relating specifies a view of the immediate parent assembly of the constituent. &lt;note&gt;A constituent can be a single part or an assembly.&lt;/note&gt; &lt;example&gt;The assembly carburettor can be assembled from single parts. The power train assembly is assembled from other assemblies.&lt;/example&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <name>NextAssemblyOccurrenceUsage</name>
