        <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491290805_397814_95984" xmi:uuid="a81da98d-dbe0-4186-a783-0ce723205681" xmi:type="uml:Association">
          <memberEnd xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491340555_163183_132453"/>
          <memberEnd xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491339990_674259_132112"/>
          <ownedEnd xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491340555_163183_132453" xmi:uuid="614ff6b5-4383-4a55-8698-3542be75b9e0" xmi:type="uml:Property">
            <type xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491290757_130087_95954"/>
            <lowerValue xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491432272_900645_190385" xmi:uuid="4d735aaa-2a43-46ee-9aa5-d9f1948a53c2" xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger"/>
            <association xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491290805_397814_95984"/>
          </ownedEnd>
        </packagedElement>
        <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491290774_83775_95957" xmi:uuid="a9a2976c-861c-4295-b8ab-c21484f801ce" xmi:type="uml:Class">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491340177_630814_132205" xmi:uuid="1eaf3c95-b614-41f8-98f8-db84e6c1ef87" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491290774_83775_95957"/>
            <body>A QuantifiedOccurrence is a type of DefinitionBasedOccurrence which is quantified, or whose quantity depends on certain constraints. &lt;example&gt; Radiator liquid or engine oil are examples for QuantifiedOccurrence objects. &lt;/example&gt;&lt;example&gt; In a TechnicalSolution for the front left brake a certain screw is used four times. &lt;/example&gt;&lt;example&gt; In a BOM where the exact amount of grease or glue can usually not be specified as a quantity, the specification of this grease or glue are examples for giving just a selection criterion instead of an exact quantity. &lt;/example&gt;&lt;example&gt; To minimize the concentricity error of a wheel, weights are attached to the rim; this set of weights is a QuantifiedOccurrence whose quantity is defined by a criterion. The quantity as well as the position of these weights depends on the concentricity behaviour of each specific wheel as manufactured and tested.&lt;/example&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <name>QuantifiedOccurrence</name>
          <ownedRule xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491340110_282693_132169" xmi:uuid="f4c4253d-232a-4aa5-b1d5-3ea9f9ed17dc" xmi:type="uml:Constraint">
            <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491431779_42201_190036" xmi:uuid="905d0793-a95f-4fce-b84c-780a78909fbb" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
              <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491340110_282693_132169"/>
              <body>either Quantity or Criterion or both shall be defined</body>
            </ownedComment>
            <name>WR1</name>
            <constrainedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491290774_83775_95957"/>
            <specification xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491431779_490057_190035" xmi:uuid="ea162be1-9d91-4fc5-b369-0c8b69ee5c3f" xmi:type="uml:OpaqueExpression">
              <body>not(self.Quantity.oclIsUndefined()) or not(self.Criterion.oclIsUndefined())</body>
              <language>OCL2.0</language>
            </specification>
          </ownedRule>
          <generalization xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491337418_392811_130764" xmi:uuid="d6b983d3-b46e-42b7-bdfd-ed653ec67bed" xmi:type="uml:Generalization">
            <general xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491290636_432305_95939"/>
          </generalization>
          <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491340177_597638_132207" xmi:uuid="4987f2a1-19d3-4afc-9a5b-26498c3cbdfc" xmi:type="uml:Property">
            <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491431892_383266_190083" xmi:uuid="d8de5c11-9251-41d6-82fb-bf4a239b918b" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
              <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491340177_597638_132207"/>
              <body>a ValueWithUnit specifying the quantity of occurrences. The value of this attribute need not be specified. &lt;note&gt; The quantity can be specified as a count measure, as a mass measure, as a length measure, as an area measure, or as a volume measure. &lt;/note&gt; &lt;example&gt; The quantity of engine oil used in a car can be in the range of 3.7 to 3.9 litres. This is expressed using ValueRange as the quantity.&lt;/example&gt;</body>
            </ownedComment>
            <name>Quantity</name>
            <visibility>public</visibility>
            <type xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491287358_768221_92668"/>
            <lowerValue xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491431892_912474_190084" xmi:uuid="821003ae-46ce-48fe-a05a-2008ccc9320d" xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger"/>
            <aggregation>composite</aggregation>
            <association xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491290808_334019_95990"/>
          </ownedAttribute>
          <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491340180_366408_132208" xmi:uuid="14025361-3e94-4f19-883e-002cc3120ebf" xmi:type="uml:Property">
            <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491431893_626041_190087" xmi:uuid="272592b3-d9d5-4431-9c4c-abf427b603c5" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
              <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491340180_366408_132208"/>
              <body>the constraint that has to be evaluated for the QuantifiedOccurrence. &lt;example&gt; 'as required for balance' and 'as required for lubrication' are examples for a criterion.&lt;/example&gt; The value of this attribute need not be specified.</body>
            </ownedComment>
            <name>Criterion</name>
            <visibility>public</visibility>
            <type xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491287136_221826_92504"/>
            <lowerValue xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491431893_639649_190088" xmi:uuid="5ff033df-db08-468d-ba15-5e5ada7a81e8" xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger"/>
            <aggregation>composite</aggregation>
            <association xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491290819_242798_96012"/>
          </ownedAttribute>
