            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491290757_130087_95954"/>
            <body>An AssemblyViewRelationship is the relationship between an AssemblyDefinition and a PartView representing a view of the assembly. An AssemblyViewRelationship is a type of PartViewRelationship. The AssemblyDefinition and the PartView shall share at least one ViewContext.</body>
