        <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491290585_288398_95931" xmi:uuid="bce3feb4-7c14-4dc8-9d85-079e66354f19" xmi:type="uml:Class">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491336555_628270_130295" xmi:uuid="0f60099b-4da8-452b-adc9-52575d937aaf" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491290585_288398_95931"/>
            <body>A SingleOccurrence is a subtype of DefinitionBasedOccurrence. It is one specific occurrence of an object that uses an item (specified by OccurrenceDefinitionSelect) as its definition. &lt;note&gt;A SingleOccurrence can or cannot be associated with placement information using an OccurrencePlacement. &lt;/note&gt;&lt;example&gt;In a TechnicalSolution for the 'front left brake', a 'brake disk' is used and its position is specified by a geometric Transformation.&lt;/example&gt; A SingleOccurrence is a type of Occurrence.</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <name>SingleOccurrence</name>
