        <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491290780_338716_95959" xmi:uuid="e837a459-8fa4-427e-bcbe-146cc54e009f" xmi:type="uml:Class">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491340272_792741_132273" xmi:uuid="34035e68-fc2b-4f0e-8c31-688279836806" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491290780_338716_95959"/>
            <body>A PromissoryAssemblyViewUsage is a type of AssemblyViewRelationship. A PromissoryAssemblyViewUsage is a relationship between a Related view of an assembly constituent and a Relating view of the assembly itself. The relationship describes the intention to use the view of an assembly constituent in an assembly. The constituent or the assembly that is associated by a PromissoryAssemblyViewUsage can have no geometric information.</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <name>PromissoryAssemblyViewUsage</name>
