            <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491433084_996995_190967" xmi:uuid="8fdec72f-0cef-441f-b943-22fff59489fe" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
              <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491341268_152409_132934"/>
              <body> the other object of ProductGroup that is part of the relationship. &lt;note&gt; The semantics of this attribute are defined by the attribute RelationType.&lt;/note&gt; If one ProductGroup in the relationship is dependent upon the other, this attribute shall be the dependent one.</body>
