        <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491290154_579512_95345" xmi:uuid="1c530987-f340-456c-b3fc-47a353b93f91" xmi:type="uml:Class">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491334931_144003_129312" xmi:uuid="5e3c32d2-8e77-4e93-bf2a-a5e6529e09e2" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491290154_579512_95345"/>
            <body>A TypeOfPersonDefinition is the definition of a TypeOfPerson in terms of required properties or attributes. &lt;example&gt;A junior mechanical design engineer could be specified to be either someone who has&lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;3 years experience of working in a mechanical design department, or&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;a degree in mechanical engineering.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/example&gt;</body>
