            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491290145_889727_95344"/>
            <body>A QualificationType is the identification of a definitive recognition as a practitioner. &lt;example&gt; A driving licence.&lt;/example&gt; &lt;example&gt;A qualification for executing the Ground Running task for RB211 engines.&lt;/example&gt; &lt;example&gt;A Military rank such as Colonel, or Captain.&lt;/example&gt; &lt;example&gt; Educational qualification such as GCSE, A level, Degree, Ordinary National Certificate, Higher National Certificate, City and Guilds, or GNVQ.&lt;/example&gt;</body>
