    <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491285002_992834_89825" xmi:uuid="2e1ddd1f-eef1-45ce-acfb-f0a18e9a987d" xmi:type="uml:Package">
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491285102_323200_89912" xmi:uuid="cb1bc368-53ef-42f5-9bcb-b5e024d64789" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491285002_992834_89825"/>
        <body>The System capability represents information concerning the representation of systems. The capability allows the representation of several versions of a given system and the relationships between these versions. &lt;br/&gt;The figure below provides an overview of the capability. &lt;figuresysml&gt;&lt;id&gt;_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491293022_233418_97958&lt;/id&gt;Block Definition Diagram of the System CTC&lt;/figuresysml&gt;</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>System</name>
      <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491285101_358817_89910" xmi:uuid="8b8d006c-1bfc-4dad-9f25-dd1a73f2e816" xmi:type="uml:Package">
        <name>Diagrams</name>
      </packagedElement>
      <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491285101_730430_89911" xmi:uuid="af541d3f-bc32-4542-a8c2-6379e49cc539" xmi:type="uml:Package">
        <name>ModelElements</name>
        <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491293043_302113_97979" xmi:uuid="0064bfc6-d205-4e5e-9648-2bc524a2773b" xmi:type="uml:Class">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491360834_303164_142207" xmi:uuid="91d68c83-9bcc-467c-bc7c-1fc965727965" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491293043_302113_97979"/>
            <body>A System is used to identify a conceptual solution to a collection of requirements. &lt;note&gt;The concept system is any thing - matter, energy, organisation or information or a combination of these - for which reproducible measurements exist. The concept system excludes any asserted thing based on personal experience for which no reproducible measurements exist.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <name>System</name>
