        <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491293068_856504_97980" xmi:uuid="296e2bf9-47a6-4cbb-b510-2f14e5228f5c" xmi:type="uml:Class">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491361237_448343_142345" xmi:uuid="261ae2e0-7127-4d6c-b62c-958de1b0b6fa" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491293068_856504_97980"/>
            <body>A SystemVersion represents a particular version of a system. &lt;note&gt;In this case, this means "revision". A given system can have several versions of system design.&lt;/note&gt; &lt;example&gt; A fuel injection system can have a system design version v1 and a system design version v1.1.&lt;/example&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <name>SystemVersion</name>
