              <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491302829_666472_107118"/>
              <body>the string that specifies the identifier of the Language. The value of this attribute shall conform either to an Alpha-2 code of ISO 639-1 or to an Alpha-3 bibliographic code of ISO 639-2 if no two-character code exists.</body>
            </ownedComment>
