            <body>A RelationshipObject is a generalization of all relationships in the Core model used to identify common properties of relationships. A Relationship is defined to be a dependency between two objects. &lt;note&gt;The objects being related are normally, but not always, of the same type or specializations.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
