              <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491303515_604084_108147"/>
              <body> the meaning of the relationship. This information is defined by reference data. The ReferenceData tab provides definitions of the Reference Data currently standardized for PropertyDefinitionAssignmentRelationship.</body>
