            <body>An AssignmentObject is a generalization of all assignments in the Core model used to identify common properties of assignments. &lt;note&gt;The object being assigned is normally, but not always, of a different type to the target of the assignment.&lt;/note&gt; &lt;note&gt;An assignment implies a direction from an object to a target object.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
