            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491287344_949550_92660"/>
            <body>A Unit is a quantity chosen as a standard in terms of which other quantities can be expressed. The types of units supported by this standard are SI units as well as derived or conversion-based units as defined in ISO 10303-41.</body>
          </ownedComment>
