            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491286746_83740_91986"/>
            <body>An EnvironmentAssignment is an assignment of an environment (via EnvironmentDefinitionView) to an item (specified by EnvironmentAssignmentSelect). The meaning of the assignment can be specified using the ClassifiedAs attribute inherited from the AssignmentObject.</body>
