        <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491286955_488151_92358" xmi:uuid="75191d93-788a-4a7d-b8c4-1f080e3c3bb7" xmi:type="uml:Class">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491303679_618954_108306" xmi:uuid="02b236b9-3ebd-4758-a60f-5b9039e50236" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491286955_488151_92358"/>
            <body>A StatePredicted is a type of State. It represents an occurrence of the State of something in the future. Where a predicted state needs to be related to a StateObserved, the StatePredictedToObserved entity shall be used. &lt;example&gt;It is anticipated that the aircraft will land in an un-serviceable state. Hence a set of maintenance activities are started.&lt;/example&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
