            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491287213_943790_92579"/>
            <body>A PropertyDefinitionAssignment is an assignment of a PropertyDefinition to an item (specified by PropertyAssignmentSelect). &lt;example&gt; A property 'mass' defined in 'kg' can be assigned to a Part.&lt;/example&gt; The meaning of the assignment can be specified using the ClassifiedAs attribute inherited from the AssignmentObject.</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <name>PropertyDefinitionAssignment</name>
          <ownedRule xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491308645_794594_112506" xmi:uuid="69d15265-96e2-4357-acf5-d9c16d12b3ef" xmi:type="uml:Constraint">
