            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491286664_714259_91839"/>
            <body>A StateComposition is a type of StateRelationship and it relates the nature of states in relation to one another, where two or more Related State parts compose a whole Relating State; and furthermore, whole states can become parts of yet another whole State.</body>
