            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491286686_478175_91877"/>
            <body>A StateDefinition is a mode of being. In formal systems, a StateDefinition is the definition of a situation during which some (usually implicit) invariant condition holds. &lt;example&gt;The definition of the state, ”flying” is that the aircraft is off the ground.&lt;/example&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
