            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491286813_339741_92100"/>
            <body>A model artefact that allows a generic data type to be used as a class object for a select. The ClassStringProxy allows for the representation of a class as a string. &lt;note&gt;As it is a modelling artefact, it cannot be represented in the implementation form if the implementation languages have more efficient representation of the type in the select.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <name>ClassStringProxy</name>
