              <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491303545_83204_108174"/>
              <body> the meaning of the relationship. This information is defined by reference data. The ReferenceData tab provides definitions of the Reference Data currently standardized for PropertyValueAssignmentRelationship. </body>
            </ownedComment>
