              <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491303547_555224_108176"/>
              <body> one object of PropertyValueAssignment that is part of the relationship. &lt;note&gt; The semantics of this attribute are defined by the attribute RelationType.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
