        <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491286757_863095_92015" xmi:uuid="a65e85e3-35f2-468a-b930-6d0cc8d5120e" xmi:type="uml:Class">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491302025_80515_106181" xmi:uuid="0cd23e8c-2828-4124-b766-fc59e0ddde3a" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491286757_863095_92015"/>
            <body>An EnvironmentDefinitionView is a specialization of EnvironmentView that provides a view of a version of an environment definition relevant for one or more application domains. This view collects the characteristics that define an Environment.&lt;note&gt; The characteristics include the resources available, the locations in which the product is to operate as well as climatic conditions such temperature ranges.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <name>EnvironmentDefinitionView</name>
