              <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491303563_740949_108188"/>
              <body> the meaning of the relationship. This information is defined by reference data. The ReferenceData tab provides definitions of the Reference Data currently standardized for ProxyRelationship. </body>
