            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491287326_770801_92649"/>
            <body>A TimeIntervalAssignment is an assignment of a TimeInterval to an item (specified by TimeIntervalAssignmentSelect). The TimeIntervalAssignment shall neither be used to convey effectivity information, such as information concerning valid use of product data, nor to convey retention information, nor duration information. &lt;note&gt; Such information is conveyed using Effectivity, RetentionPeriod, and Duration respectively. &lt;/note&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <name>TimeIntervalAssignment</name>
