            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491287351_546011_92662"/>
            <body>A ValueLimit is a type of NumericalValue with a qualified numerical value representing either the lower limit or the upper limit of a specific physical characteristic. &lt;example&gt;'30.5 max' and '5 min' are examples for a ValueLimit.&lt;/example&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
