            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491286960_553560_92379"/>
            <body>A RelatedConditionParameter is an association between a ConditionParameter and a parameter (specified by EvaluationParameterSelect). This association is used to record the association between the parameters used to define a condition and the parameters used to evaluate it. </body>
          </ownedComment>
          <name>RelatedConditionParameter</name>
