            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491287082_606506_92456"/>
            <body>A StateDefinitionComposition is a type of StateDefinitionRelationship. It relates StateDefinition entities to one another, when two or more Related StateDefinition entities act as parts to compose a whole Relating StateDefinition; and furthermore, whole StateDefinition entities can become parts of yet another whole StateDefinition.</body>
          </ownedComment>
