              <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491304209_20646_108824"/>
              <body>the meaning of the relationship. This information is defined by reference data. The ReferenceData tab provides definitions of the Reference Data currently standardized for EnvironmentDefinitionViewRelationship. </body>
            </ownedComment>
