              <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491303390_653436_108022"/>
              <body> the other object of Event that is part of the relationship. &lt;note&gt; The semantics of this attribute are defined by the attribute RelationType.&lt;/note&gt; If one Event in the relationship is dependent upon the other, this attribute shall be the dependent one.</body>
