            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491286783_691141_92064"/>
            <body>An ObservedEnvironmentView is a specialization of EnvironmentView that provides a view of a version of an observed environment relevant for one or more application domains. This view collects the characteristics of the observations on the environment.</body>
