          <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491306060_503795_110325" xmi:uuid="7e2c40ab-339c-4890-97df-601c3171c33a" xmi:type="uml:Property">
            <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491381535_779049_160356" xmi:uuid="49e0122e-38ee-4240-9b26-7c47e9b8c688" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
              <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491306060_503795_110325"/>
              <body>the indication whether the assignedEffectivity defines a period of effectivity (value equal 'TRUE') or a period of ineffectivity (value equal 'FALSE') for the AssignedTo object. In the first case, the use of AssignedTo object is or was valid during the considered period. In the second case, the use of AssignedTo object is or was not valid during the considered period.</body>
