          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491307602_533108_111588" xmi:uuid="2e275d4e-9a3a-4e4c-8768-10154ac6df69" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491287143_768540_92516"/>
            <body>A MeasureQualification is a means to provide information about measurements in which there is an associated uncertainty. The uncertainty can be specified as precision, qualitative uncertainty, or expanded uncertainty, and the type of the related datum shall be included. The uncertainty is defined in clause 2 of 'The Guide to the Expression of Uncertainty in Measurement'.</body>
          </ownedComment>
