              <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491298243_988969_103497"/>
              <body>if the Member is a CollectionView then the Member and the OfCollection CollectionView shall be different.</body>
            </ownedComment>
            <name>WR1</name>
            <constrainedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491285839_133884_90708"/>
