            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491292392_531578_97472"/>
            <body>A ResourceItem is an item that can occur in the role of a resource within the application context. &lt;example&gt;A ResourceItem can be classified as "Facility", "Replaceable unit", or "Package".&lt;/example&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
