        <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491292354_630840_97459" xmi:uuid="05ca63d4-5269-4443-8d2c-6b2015c8c707" xmi:type="uml:Class">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491353661_931817_139025" xmi:uuid="89d2cbc9-e42c-4c8b-88ad-ce65c091e455" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491292354_630840_97459"/>
            <body>A ResourceAsRealizedAssociation is an association between the record of used or consumed resources (via ResourceAsRealized) and the corresponding item (specified by ResourceAsRealizedRelationshipSelect). &lt;example&gt;"Alternative" and "Corresponding" are examples of classifications of resource as realized association.&lt;/example&gt; &lt;note&gt;A resource used or consumed can be recorded without having a corresponding resource requirement statement.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
