            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491292439_805293_97486"/>
            <body>A ResourceItemAssignment is an assignment of a resource item to an item (specified by ResourceItemAssignmentSelect). The meaning of the assignment can be specified using the ClassifiedAs attribute inherited from the AssignmentObject. &lt;example&gt;The assignment can be classified as "applicable to" or "acquired for". &lt;/example&gt;</body>
