            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491292325_965845_97448"/>
            <body>A ResourceEventCorrespondenceAssociation is an association between a resource event and a corresponding statement of RequiredResource. &lt;note&gt;A resource event can be planned or recorded without having a corresponding resource requirement statement.&lt;/note&gt; &lt;example&gt;A resource event correspondence association can be classified as "Designated for".&lt;/example&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
