            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491292437_693793_97484"/>
            <body>A ResourceGroupRelationship is a specialization of ResourceItemRelationship that is a relationship between two ResourceItem objects that are part of a resource group. &lt;example&gt;The relationship between a tool set and a mallet could be classified as "Contains".&lt;/example&gt; &lt;example&gt;The relationship between a facility and compressed air could be classified as "Provides".&lt;/example&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <name>ResourceGroupRelationship</name>
          <generalization xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491354728_155681_139501" xmi:uuid="0b02c96d-20da-4c34-b4a7-b4f11757d23a" xmi:type="uml:Generalization">
