            <body>A ResourceAsRealizedAssignment is an assignment of a resource record statement (via ResourceAsRealized) to an item (specified by ResourceAsRealizedAssignmentSelect) that used or consumed the resource. The meaning of the assignment can be specified using the ClassifiedAs attribute inherited from the AssignmentObject. </body>
