            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491293458_838878_98253"/>
            <body>A RepeatCount is a type of LoopingElement. It invokes a specified number of repetitions of the RepeatedElement inherited from LoopingElement. </body>
