            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491293360_687402_98207"/>
            <body>A TaskMethodAssignment is a specialization of an AssignmentObject that represents an assignment of a TaskMethod to an item (specified by TaskAssignmentSelect). The meaning of the assignment can be specified using the ClassifiedAs attribute inherited from the AssignmentObject.</body>
