        <body>This capability represents information concerning work order and work request information. The capability enables to collect and structure work requests in order to elaborate work order that justify change activities. &lt;br/&gt;The figure below provides an overview of the capability. &lt;figuresysml&gt;&lt;id&gt;_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491293497_733842_98316&lt;/id&gt;Block Definition Diagram of the Work Management CTC&lt;/figuresysml&gt;</body>
      </ownedComment>
