        <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491289598_35595_94857" xmi:uuid="42018a88-9bbe-45ba-b950-b4de0e3cc14d" xmi:type="uml:Class">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491330331_956857_126716" xmi:uuid="a4499fe0-82dd-46b5-b809-a1286fcc806b" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491289598_35595_94857"/>
            <body>An Observation is an historical record of something that has occurred during the life of a product or its support environment. Its use is restricted to observations not directly represented in the data model, and should not be used where some other reporting data structure is defined.</body>
