              <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491330340_13727_126720"/>
              <body>the identifier or set of identifiers for the Observation. &lt;note&gt;This attribute supports multi-identification in different contexts as described in Fundamental concepts and assumptions.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
            </ownedComment>
