            <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491410960_373417_182792" xmi:uuid="ee9b898a-1ae6-4489-a9b7-68a9f132b96f" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
              <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491330348_139008_126723"/>
              <body>the person or equipment that did the observing. By default this is a piece of physical equipment, represented by RealizedIndividualPart. The value of this attribute need not be specified. &lt;note&gt;One use of Observation is to provide a link between health monitoring equipment and the file it produces (recorded as a Document).&lt;/note&gt;</body>
            </ownedComment>
