            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491289628_504847_94861"/>
            <body>An ObservationAssignment is an assignment of an Observation to an item (specified by ObservationAssignmentSelect) being observed, or to any item that can be used as part of the observation. The meaning of the assignment can be specified using the ClassifiedAs attribute inherited from the AssignmentObject.</body>
