      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491285085_620382_89894" xmi:uuid="9eb1941f-7344-4bc1-ad8c-4ee48a633f8b" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491285000_695015_89820"/>
        <body>This capability provides the ability to represent geometric models describing the shape of a part. Geometric structures and transformations are supported by describing the relationships between geometric models. The following figures illustrate the different ways, how two geometric models can be related: by a placement transformation, by a cartesian transformation, or without a transformation. &lt;note&gt;The transformation matrices are not guaranteed to be orthogonal. Therefore, in the case of multi-level assembly the concatenation of the transformation matrices can result in inconsistent or incorrect results between exchange partners.&lt;/note&gt; &lt;figuresysml&gt;&lt;id&gt;_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491291372_153711_96604&lt;/id&gt;Relating geometric models by a placement transformation&lt;/figuresysml&gt; &lt;figuresysml&gt;&lt;id&gt;_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491291387_347423_96625&lt;/id&gt;Relating geometric models by a cartesian transformation&lt;/figuresysml&gt; &lt;figuresysml&gt;&lt;id&gt;_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491291402_486623_96646&lt;/id&gt;Relating geometric models without a transformation&lt;/figuresysml&gt; This capability represents the information necessary to transform elements from different geometric coordinate spaces and coordinate systems.&lt;note&gt;The RepresentationAndExternalElementReference Core Technical Capability has the following domain objects that are known to have issues and will be updated in the near future:&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;TopologyGeometryAssociationTopologicalItemsSelect;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;TopologyGeometryAssociationTopologicalItemsSelect;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;GeometryToTopologyRepresentationAssociation;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;TopologyToGeometryAssociationByMultipleElementPairs.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/note&gt; </body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>RepresentationAndExternalElementReference</name>
