        </packagedElement>
        <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491291462_781764_96718" xmi:uuid="0f7542d7-4201-4423-a438-fe4688de8da1" xmi:type="uml:Class">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491345803_826356_135231" xmi:uuid="3583d315-a50a-4bc7-a36f-2873cd9cbf57" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491291462_781764_96718"/>
            <body>An AxisPlacement is a type of DetailedGeometricModelItem that defines a right-handed, 2D or 3D, local coordinate system within the main coordinate system provided by the enclosing GeometricCoordinateSpace. The first direction for the local x-axis is defined by the attribute RefDirection. If this attribute is not defined, then the default value is the same as the x-axis of the global coordinate system. The second direction of the local coordinate system is perpendicular to the first direction. The optional third direction for the local z-axis is defined by the attribute RefDirection. If this attribute is not defined, then the default value is the same as the z-axis of the global coordinate system. In the 3D case the second direction of the local y-axes is defined by the vector product of z- and x-direction. &lt;note&gt;The order is important. The 'vector product of x- and z-direction would only provide the inverse y-direction.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <name>AxisPlacement</name>
          <ownedRule xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491345720_568768_135190" xmi:uuid="01dec508-dde3-41a7-abfa-a3a2cb68406b" xmi:type="uml:Constraint">
            <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491437917_58095_194249" xmi:uuid="9bde646d-debb-4fd4-bbd5-626c7460e5d0" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
              <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491345720_568768_135190"/>
              <body>if RefDirection is defined, its dimensionality shall be 2 or 3.</body>
            </ownedComment>
            <name>RefDirectionLowerBound</name>
            <constrainedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491291462_781764_96718"/>
            <specification xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491437917_324073_194248" xmi:uuid="37c1ead4-96c8-4718-82c1-3949430a385b" xmi:type="uml:OpaqueExpression">
              <body>RefDirection-&gt;isEmpty () xor (RefDirection-&gt;size () &gt;= 2)</body>
              <language>OCL2.0</language>
            </specification>
          </ownedRule>
          <ownedRule xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491345718_243618_135189" xmi:uuid="06b89596-fd75-4b16-ac99-3624473f1e24" xmi:type="uml:Constraint">
            <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491437916_891116_194247" xmi:uuid="df5f4bdd-15f3-421f-972c-d437a3712e00" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
              <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491345718_243618_135189"/>
              <body>the attribute Axis shall be unset in the 2D case because it defines the z-Direction of the local coordinate system. </body>
            </ownedComment>
            <name>NoAxisDefinedFor2DAxisPlacement</name>
            <constrainedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491291462_781764_96718"/>
            <specification xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491437916_419219_194246" xmi:uuid="9b1091e9-89c1-4f66-8a91-46798a3838fa" xmi:type="uml:OpaqueExpression">
              <body>(self.Position-&gt;size() = 2) implies (self.Axis-&gt;isEmpty())</body>
              <language>OCL2.0</language>
            </specification>
          </ownedRule>
          <ownedRule xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491345715_407918_135188" xmi:uuid="71b0ba3b-0d8d-449a-87f8-889993a83c24" xmi:type="uml:Constraint">
            <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491437914_30591_194244" xmi:uuid="408dbe37-4004-4c44-ab07-832cb9ea527e" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
              <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491345715_407918_135188"/>
              <body>if Axis is defined, its dimensionality shall be 3.</body>
            </ownedComment>
            <name>AxisLowerBound</name>
            <constrainedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491291462_781764_96718"/>
            <specification xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491437913_318418_194243" xmi:uuid="865a6e86-5787-46da-89c9-c11a827e5112" xmi:type="uml:OpaqueExpression">
              <body>Axis-&gt;isEmpty() xor (Axis-&gt;size() = 3)</body>
              <language>OCL2.0</language>
            </specification>
          </ownedRule>
          <ownedRule xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491345722_619300_135191" xmi:uuid="862b17a8-537c-4dc0-ae08-0ae4217ff18b" xmi:type="uml:Constraint">
            <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491437921_32367_194252" xmi:uuid="1ea4e64a-1b09-4582-a43c-3730c65381e4" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
              <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491345722_619300_135191"/>
              <body> the dimensionality of the AxisPlacement shall be greater than 0.</body>
            </ownedComment>
            <name>WR1</name>
            <constrainedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491291462_781764_96718"/>
            <specification xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491437920_366882_194251" xmi:uuid="e2fe8989-d247-4196-a000-7e9f4cd73a8f" xmi:type="uml:OpaqueExpression">
              <body>self.RefDirection-&gt;size() = self.Position-&gt;size()</body>
              <language>OCL2.0</language>
            </specification>
          </ownedRule>
          <ownedRule xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491345725_602763_135192" xmi:uuid="be73d62d-f7ba-4598-81d8-86eaa4b1fb2c" xmi:type="uml:Constraint">
            <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491437924_199806_194255" xmi:uuid="70d06c57-ad69-4163-ae62-791e645c9931" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
              <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491345725_602763_135192"/>
              <body>if Axis is defined, its dimensionality shall be identical to the dimensionality of Position.</body>
            </ownedComment>
            <name>WR2</name>
            <constrainedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491291462_781764_96718"/>
            <specification xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491437924_437400_194254" xmi:uuid="3d5c40cc-7ce7-45e1-8d7a-192681d5329a" xmi:type="uml:OpaqueExpression">
              <body>(self.Axis-&gt;size() &gt; 0) implies (self.Axis-&gt;size() = 3 and self.Position-&gt;size() = 3)</body>
              <language>OCL2.0</language>
            </specification>
          </ownedRule>
          <generalization xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491345715_386565_135186" xmi:uuid="5751f0a4-873c-4351-88ba-e5b707d6b9f9" xmi:type="uml:Generalization">
