              <body>the relative x, y and optionally z value specifying the reference direction used to determine the direction of the local X axis of the AxisPlacement. The value of this attribute need not be specified. If RefDirection is not provided then Axis shall be assumed to have the value (1, 0) respectively (1, 0, 0) depending of the size of the Position value.</body>
