              <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491346959_151819_135887"/>
              <body> the radius of a sphere that encloses all elements of the GeometricModel. The centre of the sphere is located at the origin of the GeometricCoordinateSpace of the GeometricModel. The value of this attribute need not be specified.</body>
            </ownedComment>
            <name>ModelExtent</name>
