            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491291451_815927_96712"/>
            <body>A GeneralGeometricRepresentationRelationship is a type of GeometricRepresentationRelationship that defines a user-defined relationship between two GeometricModel objects whose meaning is defined by the attribute RelationType. </body>
