              <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491346896_451895_135847"/>
              <body>a list, the individual elements of this list are defined below. &lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Coordinates[1]: The first coordinate of the CartesianPoint location. &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Coordinates[2]: The second coordinate of the CartesianPoint location. &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Coordinates[3]: The third coordinate of the CartesianPoint location; this will not exist in the case of a two-dimensional point.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; </body>
            </ownedComment>
            <name>Coordinates</name>
            <visibility>public</visibility>
            <type xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491291450_191701_96711"/>
