          </ownedAttribute>
          <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491345579_281621_135090" xmi:uuid="55841dcd-31d0-4828-b5dd-372b42314a95" xmi:type="uml:Property">
            <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491437819_287675_194168" xmi:uuid="fb54f93a-0d7c-4973-b9a7-0e84797a6bf8" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
              <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491345579_281621_135090"/>
              <body>the GeometricModel (via GeometricRepresentationRelationship) that specifies the source of the transformation. The value of this attribute is created automatically.</body>
            </ownedComment>
