            <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491433613_502252_191381" xmi:uuid="8f38baab-95c0-474e-90c0-de792bff70c0" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
              <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491341899_808043_133212"/>
              <body> the PartVersion that identifies a part which is a valid implementation for the ProductConfiguration.</body>
