          <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491344346_947815_134397" xmi:uuid="701bb94e-5943-4309-be70-aaa6274ba57f" xmi:type="uml:Property">
            <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491436732_1788_193377" xmi:uuid="480d0f07-5565-420c-9906-9f8171012a8f" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
              <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491344346_947815_134397"/>
              <body> specifies whether the Specification objects referring to the associated SpecificationCategory have to be used or can be used (optional) for products within the referenced ProductClass. A value of 'true' indicates that the usage is mandatory. &lt;example&gt;The specification category 'radio' can be associated 'optional' to the product class of a car; the specification category 'engine' is an example for a 'mandatory' association.&lt;/example&gt;</body>
