        <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491291150_449909_96290" xmi:uuid="c726b27c-ccf7-4d36-a580-dee37a581773" xmi:type="uml:Class">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491344513_414586_134480" xmi:uuid="288249c7-2f0b-4f11-b81c-bddae03fa6f9" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491291150_449909_96290"/>
            <body>A SpecificationInclusionAssignment is an assignment of a SpecificationInclusion to a ProductClass. This assignment contains the information that a specific SpecificationInclusion applies for all products of that ProductClass. The meaning of the assignment can be specified using the ClassifiedAs attribute inherited from the AssignmentObject.</body>
          </ownedComment>
