              <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491344121_293812_134291"/>
              <body> the identifier or set of identifiers for the Specification. &lt;note&gt; This attribute supports multi-identification in different contexts as described in Fundamental concepts and assumptions.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
            </ownedComment>
