              <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491344130_231749_134294"/>
              <body> the classifications of the Specification. This information is defined by reference data. The ReferenceData tab provides definitions of the Reference Data currently standardized for Specification. The value of this attribute need not be specified.</body>
