        <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491291060_176136_96281" xmi:uuid="e2c7ba3d-77c8-4604-8383-de422158d0fd" xmi:type="uml:Class">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491342670_474547_133586" xmi:uuid="1d259989-4207-4ddc-9f35-d8ebaf8bc3b8" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491291060_176136_96281"/>
            <body>A SpecificationInclusion is a representation of the statement that specifies that the conformance to an item (IfCondition, specified by ConditionParameterSelect) implies the conformance to an additional item (IncludedSpecification, specified by ConditionParameterSelect). &lt;example&gt;The source of such a completion can be a customer order. &lt;/example&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <name>SpecificationInclusion</name>
