              <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491342681_474509_133591"/>
              <body> the items (specified by ConditionParameterSelect) that are to be included. The IncludedSpecification shall not reference a Condition with an operation of type 'or' or 'oneof', except for negating expressions (as participants in an expression preceded by a 'not' operator). Expressions of operator 'not' shall not be nested within one another. &lt;br/&gt;In the case where more than one Specification is to be included a Condition of type 'and' shall be used. &lt;note&gt; In the case where the includedSpecification is a 'not' expression, the object actually defines an exclusion.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
            </ownedComment>
