        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491284998_744788_89815"/>
        <body>The PlanningScheduling capability represents information concerning plans and schedules. It includes the modeling of ordered list of scheme entries and their relationships, defining plans and schedules. &lt;br/&gt;The figure below provides an overview of the capability. &lt;figuresysml&gt;&lt;id&gt;_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491289675_736856_94909&lt;/id&gt;Block Definition Diagram of the PlanningScheduling CTC&lt;/figuresysml&gt;</body>
