            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491289757_328926_94996"/>
            <body>A SchemeSubjectAssignment is an assignment of a Scheme to an item (specified by SchemeSubjectAssignment). The meaning of the assignment can be specified using the ClassifiedAs attribute inherited from the AssignmentObject. &lt;note&gt;The SchemeSubjectAssignment links the Plans and Schedules with their associated subjects or targets. This can indicate the intent of the scheme.&lt;/note&gt; &lt;example&gt;The maintenance plan for an individual vehicle, where the subject attribute points to an entity instance representing that vehicle.&lt;/example&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <name>SchemeSubjectAssignment</name>
