            <body>A SchemeEntry provides the identification and description of a single entry in a specific Scheme. &lt;note&gt;A SchemeEntry can be associated with time constraints.&lt;/note&gt; &lt;note&gt; A SchemeEntry only exists within the scope of a specific Scheme.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
