            <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491411972_926379_183489" xmi:uuid="25f8b70d-e21b-40f3-a467-600562f7b766" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
              <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491331543_166140_127415"/>
              <body> the meaning of the sequencing relationship. This information is defined by reference data. The ReferenceData tab provides definitions of the Reference Data currently standardized for SequencingRelationship. </body>
