        <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491289753_863822_94994" xmi:uuid="5eb7061f-1bbc-4523-b327-4d8e1bed3dd5" xmi:type="uml:Class">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491331352_454895_127245" xmi:uuid="e8fe8709-332f-4734-ac21-13974444de66" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491289753_863822_94994"/>
            <body>A SchemeEntryAssignment is an assignment of a SchemeEntry to an item (specified by SchemeEntryAssignmentSelect). The meaning of the assignment can be specified using the ClassifiedAs attribute inherited from the AssignmentObject. &lt;example&gt;The SchemeEntryAssignment links the single items included in Plans and Schedules with their associated SchemeEntry. These items can be actions, events, or tasks depending on the nature of the Plan or Schedule.&lt;/example&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <name>SchemeEntryAssignment</name>
