              <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_aec0217_1699976350892_889185_88385"/>
              <body> the other object of SchemeEntry that is part of the relationship. &lt;note&gt;The semantics of this relationship are defined by the RelationType property.&lt;/note&gt; If one SchemeEntry in the relationship is dependent upon the other, this attribute shall be the dependent one.</body>
