          <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491329554_196506_126308" xmi:uuid="f751a418-ac2f-4a99-ad4d-38e208a00f57" xmi:type="uml:Property">
            <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491410119_361566_182217" xmi:uuid="1527da32-0801-42ce-9014-e389c9f01eb1" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
              <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491329554_196506_126308"/>
              <body> the identification of who or what (specified by MessageDefinerSelect) defined the Message, that is, identified its purpose and contents. The value of this attribute need not be specified.</body>
            </ownedComment>
