              <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491329411_707975_126224"/>
              <body> the identifier or set of identifiers for the Envelope. The value of this attribute need not be specified. &lt;note&gt;This attribute supports multi-identification in different contexts as described in Fundamental concepts and assumptions.&lt;/note&gt; </body>
            </ownedComment>
