          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491296701_551028_101930" xmi:uuid="ab2d58f9-e7ac-49b5-bc3f-4eca7dc95515" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491285648_532032_90424"/>
            <body>A BreakdownElementView is a characterization of a BreakdownElementVersion in one or more application domains and for one or more life-cycle stages. A BreakdownElementView is a collector of the properties that characterize the BreakdownElementVersion in the InitialContext and the AdditionalContexts. &lt;example&gt; The design function of a pump and its as-built function can be represented by two objects of BreakdownElementView.&lt;/example&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <name>BreakdownElementView</name>
