            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491285665_170559_90428"/>
            <body>A BreakdownVersionRelationship is a relationship between two BreakdownVersion objects. &lt;note&gt; Such relationship can exist between two BreakdownVersion instances of the same Breakdown or of different Breakdown instances.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <name>BreakdownVersionRelationship</name>
