          </ownedEnd>
        </packagedElement>
        <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491285705_925234_90593" xmi:uuid="e416f6e6-f118-4e5b-b9e8-067f1572a750" xmi:type="uml:Class">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491297360_577285_102754" xmi:uuid="4757f9a3-2dbc-470d-9fd1-db15b9dc79c9" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491285705_925234_90593"/>
            <body>A ComponentPlacement is an information object pertaining to the placement of a BreakdownElementView, which has its own GeometricCoordinateSpace, in the coordinate space of a second and reference BreakdownElementView. &lt;example&gt; An example for the use of a ComponentPlacement is the placement of the BreakdownElementView 'steering wheel' dependent on left hand versus right hand car steering in different countries.&lt;/example&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <name>ComponentPlacement</name>
          <ownedRule xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491297305_245311_102692" xmi:uuid="e8ea9712-ac2c-4901-ac03-76ef25e3381c" xmi:type="uml:Constraint">
            <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491372602_979968_150628" xmi:uuid="f60a3f1b-68e9-47f2-ba63-b91ee9f87131" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
              <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491297305_245311_102692"/>
              <body> either the Placement is of type CartesianTransformation or it is of type GeometricRepresentationRelationshipWithPlacementTransformation and the inherited attribute definitional has the value TRUE.</body>
            </ownedComment>
            <name>WR1</name>
            <constrainedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491285705_925234_90593"/>
            <specification xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491372602_573210_150627" xmi:uuid="54465fb6-84ca-4c3a-bfe9-59d371692b79" xmi:type="uml:OpaqueExpression">
              <body>self.Placement.oclIsTypeOf(Core_model::RepresentationAndExternalElementReference::ModelElements::GeometricRepresentationRelationshipWithPlacementTransformation) implies (self.Placement.oclAsType(Core_model::RepresentationAndExternalElementReference::ModelElements::GeometricRepresentationRelationshipWithPlacementTransformation).Definitional = DataTypes::Boolean::True)</body>
              <language>OCL2.0</language>
            </specification>
          </ownedRule>
          <generalization xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491297305_798141_102690" xmi:uuid="506efefd-6946-4c4d-967e-4b8569727f49" xmi:type="uml:Generalization">
            <general xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491289440_207140_94713"/>
          </generalization>
          <generalization xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491297305_48395_102691" xmi:uuid="701925b1-ef1d-4bb5-85cd-519bd802594f" xmi:type="uml:Generalization">
            <general xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491289637_3891_94862"/>
          </generalization>
          <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491297360_596559_102755" xmi:uuid="3215fad2-9ae5-4c4e-afbf-391b6474ac45" xmi:type="uml:Property">
            <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491372714_470139_150690" xmi:uuid="de19a953-c678-4d79-9b47-e6136de9567e" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
              <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491297360_596559_102755"/>
              <body>the BreakdownElementView that is positioned relative to the ReferenceComponent. &lt;note&gt; The ComponentPlacement does not define the placement for all variants of the PlacedComponent in the context of a ReferenceComponent. &lt;/note&gt;The coordinate system of the PlacedComponent is defined by the GeometricModel or ExternalGeometricModel that represents the shape of the PlacedComponent. &lt;note&gt; If the &lt;a&gt;&lt;path&gt;./4_info_reqs_Breakdown.htm#BreakdownElementView.DefiningGeometry&lt;/path&gt; DefiningGeometry &lt;/a&gt; objects of both PlacedComponent and ReferenceComponent are identical, the GeometricModel representing this shape is shared.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
            </ownedComment>
            <name>PlacedComponent</name>
            <visibility>public</visibility>
            <type xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491285648_532032_90424"/>
            <association xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491285709_928539_90605"/>
          </ownedAttribute>
          <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491297362_818339_102756" xmi:uuid="b685bdb0-ae79-47b3-9f08-d5f18786387c" xmi:type="uml:Property">
            <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491372715_490092_150694" xmi:uuid="7e0983b1-4ac9-439e-83fa-c0548d760811" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
              <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491297362_818339_102756"/>
              <body> the CartesianTransformation or the GeometricRepresentationRelationship that defines the position of the PlacedComponent relatively to the ReferenceComponent. In the case of CartesianTransformation, or GeometricRepresentationRelationshipWithCartesianTransformation, the scale shall be omitted or set to 1.0. &lt;br/&gt;The GeometricModel associated with the ReferenceComponent shall contain GeometricModel or AxisPlacement objects to locate all related placed components and can contain additional instances of geometric entities to describe shape aspects that are relevant in the context of the ReferenceComponent. &lt;example&gt; The GeometricModel or ExternalGeometricModel associated with the ReferenceComponent 'car engine' can contain GeometricModel or AxisPlacement objects that locate the gear box and the crankshaft and additional geometric information that represent the envelope box that is allowed for the car engine.&lt;/example&gt; </body>
            </ownedComment>
            <name>Placement</name>
            <visibility>public</visibility>
            <type xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491290582_990778_95929"/>
            <association xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491285707_602992_90597"/>
          </ownedAttribute>
          <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491297364_413130_102757" xmi:uuid="245fe875-7d19-4059-bb90-a2f693a0c942" xmi:type="uml:Property">
            <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491372715_57626_150698" xmi:uuid="4ed8ddc8-221e-4720-8209-fe3e50c73c86" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
              <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491297364_413130_102757"/>
              <body> the high level BreakdownElementView that is defined in the reference coordinate space. A ModelPropertyAssignment shall be assigned to the BreakdownElementView to define this reference coordinate space.</body>
            </ownedComment>
            <name>ReferenceComponent</name>
            <visibility>public</visibility>
            <type xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491285648_532032_90424"/>
            <association xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491285709_137277_90606"/>
          </ownedAttribute>
