        </packagedElement>
        <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491287753_879426_93049" xmi:uuid="19d51752-fd79-4912-9491-4aca5b6f34a9" xmi:type="uml:Class">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491315081_535130_117470" xmi:uuid="41e41701-23bd-45db-99a5-d5040c37ce29" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491287753_879426_93049"/>
            <body>An IndividualPart is the identification of an individual artefact that has been made or is planned to be made. It is a collector of data common to all versions of the IndividualPart. &lt;note&gt; Versions (IndividualPartVersion) of IndividualPart are used to represent whether an individual artefact is planned to be made or has already been made. &lt;/note&gt;&lt;note&gt; Where physical parts are being represented, an IndividualPart represents the planned or actual physical realization of a part. &lt;/note&gt;&lt;note&gt; It is likely, but not essential, that the artefact was or will be made from a part design. The part design will be represented by a PartVersion which will be related to the IndividualPart by PartToIndividualPartAssociation. &lt;/note&gt;&lt;note&gt; Many physical parts can be produced from a given design. A single Part can lead to many IndividualPart objects. &lt;/note&gt;&lt;example&gt; The design of a personal computer is represented by a PartVersion. &lt;/example&gt;&lt;example&gt; The personal computer with a serial number on a person's desk is represented by an IndividualPartVersion. &lt;/example&gt;&lt;example&gt; The personal computer that has been ordered, allocated a serial number for manufacturing planning, but not yet manufactured, is represented by an IndividualPartVersion. An actual personal computer, also represented by an IndividualPartVersion, can be linked to the planed personal computer by an IndividualPartVersionRelationship object. &lt;/example&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <name>IndividualPart</name>
          <generalization xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491314902_462138_117352" xmi:uuid="032ca18b-2575-4669-9583-f25b12ee7e64" xmi:type="uml:Generalization">
