        <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491287785_759084_93054" xmi:uuid="5f2074e2-0f8b-4e56-9305-30437a228918" xmi:type="uml:Class">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491315583_92590_117796" xmi:uuid="6c570b26-84ad-4aae-b2b6-b1973872427e" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491287785_759084_93054"/>
            <body>A RealizedIndividualPart is a type of IndividualPartVersion that represents a version of a realized artefact. &lt;note&gt; Where physical parts are being represented, the RealizedIndividualPart represents the physical part - something one can touch. &lt;/note&gt;&lt;note&gt; The artefact can have been made from a version of a part design (PartVersion). If this is the case, then the relationship between the artefact (RealizedIndividualPart) and the design (PartVersion) is represented by PartVersionToIndividualPartVersionAssociation. &lt;/note&gt;&lt;note&gt; The artefact can have been planned and represented by PlannedIndividualPart. In which case, the actual artefact (RealizedIndividualPart) is related to the planned artefact (PlannedIndividualPart) by the ProductPlannedToRealized relationship.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <name>RealizedIndividualPart</name>
          <generalization xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491314578_201639_117128" xmi:uuid="8d2434f6-bf84-4f1c-b089-8139c3bfbd59" xmi:type="uml:Generalization">
