        <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491287736_732779_93047" xmi:uuid="759ddc5d-de2b-43f8-a852-858f12d7737c" xmi:type="uml:Class">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491314763_904654_117249" xmi:uuid="373cdce2-eda4-43d4-995a-3844935d3f54" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491287736_732779_93047"/>
            <body>An IndividualPartVersion is a version of an IndividualPart and acts as a collector of the views of this version. &lt;example&gt;The car on my drive is represented by an IndividualPart. The current configuration status of the car can be represented by an IndividualPartVersion related to that IndividualPart. If a safety modification is made to the car resulting in a new configuration status of the car, then this can be represented by a new IndividualPartVersion. &lt;/example&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <name>IndividualPartVersion</name>
