        <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491287790_468281_93056" xmi:uuid="b204d476-897f-40ec-a414-4d668ee86a0d" xmi:type="uml:Class">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491315747_396260_117911" xmi:uuid="bf2ce9af-12a3-4c7b-885c-e629a524ee0a" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491287790_468281_93056"/>
            <body>A PlannedIndividualPart is a type of IndividualPartVersion that represents a version of a planned artefact. &lt;note&gt; It can be planned to make the artefact from of a version of a part design (PartVersion). If this is the case, then the relationship between the artefact (PlannedIndividualPart) and the design (PartVersion) is represented by PartVersionToIndividualPartVersionAssociation. &lt;/note&gt;&lt;note&gt; If the planned artefact (PlannedIndividualPart) is subsequently made into an actual artefact (RealizedIndividualPart) then they are related by the ProductPlannedToRealized relationship.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <name>PlannedIndividualPart</name>
          <generalization xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491314578_110142_117125" xmi:uuid="82a8d242-1fae-480a-a34e-3040de7e4f6f" xmi:type="uml:Generalization">
