        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491285002_943774_89823"/>
        <body>The Risk capability represents information concerning the management of risks. The capability allows the representation of risks, their perception by stakeholders and their consequences. &lt;br/&gt;The figure below provides an overview of the capability. &lt;figuresysml&gt;&lt;id&gt;_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491292524_8116_97611&lt;/id&gt;Block Definition Diagram of the Risk CTC&lt;/figuresysml&gt;</body>
      </ownedComment>
