            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491292618_168733_97675"/>
            <body>A RiskVersion defines a form of a risk that differ in certain respects from an earlier form of that risk or from other forms of that risk. &lt;note&gt;Use of RiskVersion allows several RiskPerception instances to be assigned to a specific Risk.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
