        <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491292692_448004_97729" xmi:uuid="46d3223f-675b-4523-878e-05ff5eda4567" xmi:type="uml:Class">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491356672_269417_140408" xmi:uuid="dacf24d0-869c-4758-8f24-060daa44aade" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491292692_448004_97729"/>
            <body>A RiskPerception is a specialization of RiskView that defines values or concerns (a risk level) with which a stakeholder views a particular Risk. The risk level is represented by a set of property values referenced from RiskLevel. If more than one property value is provided each property value shall be equivalent. &lt;example&gt;One riskLevelRepresentation could be 4 (from a maximum of 5) and a second could be"high".&lt;/example&gt; &lt;example&gt;The definition attribute of the RiskLevel could refer to a PropertyDefinition with a PropertyType attribute set to the RD individual "risk level".&lt;/example&gt; &lt;note&gt;RiskPerception depends on the stake holder's expressed needs, issues, and knowledge.&lt;/note&gt; &lt;note&gt;RiskPerception can differ from objective data.&lt;/note&gt; &lt;note&gt;RiskPerception can be used qualitatively or quantitatively to form a risk matrix.&lt;/note&gt; &lt;note&gt;Risk will be perceived differently in different contexts, such as in the context of human safety, mission success, project time schedule, performance or economy.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <name>RiskPerception</name>
          <generalization xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491356107_907792_140127" xmi:uuid="10826086-1d17-45f7-92b5-ff7c9ffc82b6" xmi:type="uml:Generalization">
            <general xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491292639_87539_97676"/>
          </generalization>
          <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491356686_79719_140413" xmi:uuid="f866de0b-b7ac-4662-94c5-faa48160bd78" xmi:type="uml:Property">
            <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491451216_276986_201998" xmi:uuid="94dae065-aa47-4fae-a3bc-5c99e02a57a2" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
              <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491356686_79719_140413"/>
              <body> the levels of risk (via PropertyValue) perceived by the RiskPerception. The definitions of the PropertyValues shall be the same. The value of this attribute need not be specified.</body>
            </ownedComment>
            <name>RiskLevel</name>
            <visibility>public</visibility>
            <type xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491287232_928876_92587"/>
            <lowerValue xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491451216_913843_201999" xmi:uuid="f34a2ef0-d2fd-4478-a69e-1065b250c670" xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger"/>
