            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491292740_677524_97758"/>
            <body>A RiskImpactAssignment is an assignment of an item that might be impacted by the risk occurring to the associated RiskConsequence. The meaning of the assignment can be specified using the ClassifiedAs attribute inherited from the AssignmentObject. </body>
