            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491292759_38101_97768"/>
            <body>A RiskEvent is a specialization of an ActivityMethodAssignment. It assigns an ActivityMethod, that represents the unwanted (or wanted) event resulting from the risk, to the RiskPerception. The probability of the event occurring is represented by a set of probabilities defined by the attribute Probability. If more than one probability is provided each probability shall be equivalent. </body>
          </ownedComment>
          <name>RiskEvent</name>
          <generalization xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491294338_384498_99153" xmi:uuid="ed4ad25a-df92-4f0c-b131-7ee13e49b004" xmi:type="uml:Generalization">
