            <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491451534_718241_202154" xmi:uuid="dafefa95-1c5e-4815-9efe-ac82ef16f537" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
              <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491357009_356644_140580"/>
              <body>one object of RiskConsequence that is the cause of the relationship. </body>
