    <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491284997_91371_89812" xmi:uuid="c3ca004b-3fd2-451b-8596-0514d8001316" xmi:type="uml:Package">
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491285059_596770_89863" xmi:uuid="11078893-7468-49db-859c-9aa5237f8c5a" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491284997_91371_89812"/>
        <body>This capability represents the management resources of the Core model.&lt;br/&gt; It allow to represents information concerning organizations and people in organizations as they perform functions related to other product data and data relationships: &lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;A person shall exist in the context of some organization; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;An organization or a person in an organization is then associated with the data or data relationship in some role indicating the function being performed; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Both people and organizations can have addresses associated with them.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; It's possible to specifies the application of Information rights. The following is in scope of this capability: &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Approval of a specific grant of a right against specific items of information;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Approval of the general grant of the right;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Association of the right to specific information items;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Definition of an information right;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Historical record of granting and revoking a right to a person or organization;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Identification of the contract under which the right is granted;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Relationship of information usage rights to each other.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; And the representation of the product and activity management information approval, certification, contract and project. These concepts are defined, and their assignments to product and activity data are specified. Relationships are enabled among approvals and among projects. &lt;br/&gt;The figure below provides an overview of the capability. &lt;figuresysml&gt;&lt;id&gt;_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491288346_842254_93698&lt;/id&gt;Overview of the Management Resources CTC&lt;/figuresysml&gt; </body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>ManagementResources</name>
      <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491285049_17604_89860" xmi:uuid="821201bb-47af-4539-b8fd-2efe924aa902" xmi:type="uml:Package">
        <name>ModelElements</name>
        <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491289070_685727_94398" xmi:uuid="003d36f0-db32-445d-b099-b008f2c40d81" xmi:type="uml:Class">
