        <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491289139_104324_94423" xmi:uuid="14dd1269-e962-4670-915e-3bb28aeeb8a5" xmi:type="uml:Class">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491326551_757078_124348" xmi:uuid="3366c35a-8950-4658-b520-9f22c6e6d8fc" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491289139_104324_94423"/>
            <body>A Project is an identified programme of work. It is a set of activities to create a product or service in accordance with specified resources and requirements. &lt;note&gt; A Project can be further characterized with planned or actual dates, allowed budget, activities or resources by attribute values of this business object or by assignments to other business objects. &lt;/note&gt;&lt;example&gt;For the development of a new car, a project is set up that is responsible for the development decisions, as well as for the accounting of the costs.&lt;/example&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <name>Project</name>
