            <body>A JustificationAssignment is an assignment of a Justification to an item (specified by JustificationAssignmentSelect). The meaning of the assignment can be specified using the ClassifiedAs attribute inherited from the AssignmentObject.&lt;note&gt;The item can be an activity or a product design.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
