        <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491289242_397429_94535" xmi:uuid="31b6011d-b9d3-4508-a3d3-344f795f3fd3" xmi:type="uml:Class">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491327849_996886_125233" xmi:uuid="8567caa1-e61d-40ef-90eb-b2f649239a62" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491289242_397429_94535"/>
            <body>A Justification is the identification and description of the reasons for something. Justification entities can be associated with the data to which they apply. &lt;example&gt;A justification can be provided for a product design. Similarly, a justification can be provided for why an activity is needed or was undertaken.&lt;/example&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
