            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491288857_935596_94241"/>
            <body>A PersonNameComponent is a constituent part of a PersonName. A non-empty set of PersonNameComponent objects makes up a person name. &lt;example&gt; "Peter" is a constituent part of the person name "Peter, Pan". &lt;/example&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <name>PersonNameComponent</name>
