          <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491321359_692564_121109" xmi:uuid="84104289-f125-4da8-b87e-e892f79ef593" xmi:type="uml:Property">
            <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491399965_849805_174984" xmi:uuid="85fc23f8-ae90-44a3-bd44-f379cc71c113" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
              <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491321359_692564_121109"/>
              <body> the identifier or set of identifiers for the AddressComponent. The value of this attribute need not be specified. &lt;note&gt;This attribute supports multi-identification in different contexts as described in Fundamental concepts and assumptions.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
