              <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491321162_760260_120999"/>
              <body>one object of Locator that is part of the relationship. &lt;note&gt; The semantics of this attribute are defined by the attribute RelationType.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
