            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491289311_328013_94561"/>
            <body>An ItemAssumed is an association between an Assumption and the item (specified by AssumedItemSelect) that is being assumed. &lt;example&gt;A facility is assumed to exist at a given location.&lt;/example&gt; The facility shall be represented by a ResourceItemAssignment, the location by a Location, and the existence of the facility at the location, by a LocationAssignment assigning a location to the resource. </body>
          </ownedComment>
          <name>ItemAssumed</name>
