            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491289155_808818_94424"/>
            <body>A PersonName is a structured combination of name components that can represent Person names in accordance with different name pattern originating from different naming conventions and cultures. A PersonName consists of a non-empty set of PersonNameComponents.</body>
