            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491289224_628453_94505"/>
            <body>A CompoundAddress is a type of Locator specified using structured information that allows unambiguous determination of an address for the purpose of communicating, using one or more communication methods. A CompoundAddress consists of a non-empty set of AddressComponents.</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <name>CompoundAddress</name>
