              <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491320865_879919_120809"/>
              <body> specifies the meaning of the CompoundAddress. This information is defined by reference data. The ReferenceData tab provides definitions of the Reference Data currently standardized for CompoundAddress.</body>
