        <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491288957_373866_94340" xmi:uuid="7241c9ad-a1ef-44d1-931c-b8f9ffeff32b" xmi:type="uml:Class">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491323559_761825_122561" xmi:uuid="430f7001-486c-481a-98b2-6539b21ce65f" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491288957_373866_94340"/>
            <body>A Certification is a written assurance by a third party that a product, process or service conforms to specified requirements. A Certification can be associated with a document that asserts the satisfaction of specific quality criteria. &lt;note&gt; Certification information can be attached to a product, tool, process, activity, service or the skill of a person for a certain task.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <name>Certification</name>
