              <body>the words or set of words by which the Certification is known. &lt;example&gt; 'AP 242 certified' is an example of a name that can be used to indicate a certification of a STEP interface. &lt;/example&gt;&lt;example&gt; 'ISO 9000' is an example of a name that can be used to indicate that a product has been developed following ISO 9000 directives.&lt;/example&gt;</body>
