            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491288785_738265_94190"/>
            <body>A LocatorAssignment is an assignment of a Locator to an item (specified by LocatorAssignmentSelect). The meaning of the assignment can be specified using the ClassifiedAs attribute inherited from the AssignmentObject. &lt;note&gt; There can be distinct assignment for each qualification (planned, scheduled or actual). Each assignment can have a start and end date or time. A locator can have multiple assignments. &lt;/note&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <name>LocatorAssignment</name>
