            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491288951_683314_94336"/>
            <body>A LocationAssignment is an assignment of a location to an item (specified by LocationAssignmentSelect). The meaning of the assignment can be specified using the ClassifiedAs attribute inherited from the AssignmentObject.&lt;note&gt; There can be distinct assignment for each qualification (planned, scheduled or actual). Each assignment can have a start and end date or time. A location can have multiple assignments. &lt;/note&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <name>LocationAssignment</name>
