            <body>An AssumptionAssignment is an assignment of an Assumption to an item (specified by AssumptionAssignmentSelect). The meaning of the assignment can be specified using the ClassifiedAs attribute inherited from the AssignmentObject. &lt;example&gt;The following set of assumptions are relevant to the project.&lt;/example&gt; </body>
