            <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491400759_373961_175925" xmi:uuid="bbc75b29-5d63-4f62-bc76-27b8921498a9" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
              <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491322340_106606_121826"/>
              <body>the other object of PersonInOrganization that is part of the relationship. &lt;note&gt; The semantics of this attribute are defined by the attribute RelationType.&lt;/note&gt; If one PersonInOrganization in the relationship is dependent upon the other, this attribute shall be the dependent one.</body>
