            <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491400891_751237_176121" xmi:uuid="26c6ec31-f889-4551-8414-ed66bf898fcc" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
              <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491322488_515122_121917"/>
              <body> the other object, specified by SuppliedObjectSelect, that is part of the relationship. &lt;note&gt; The semantics of this attribute are defined by the attribute RelationType.&lt;/note&gt; If one object in the relationship is dependent upon the other, this attribute shall be the dependent one.</body>
            </ownedComment>
