            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491289187_303547_94454"/>
            <body>A GeographicalArea is a type of Locator specified through a geographical, physical or political region. &lt;example&gt; Europe, North America, Berlin and Indian Ocean. &lt;/example&gt;</body>
