            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491289260_775157_94544"/>
            <body>A JustificationSupportAssignment is the assignment of an item (specified by JustificationSupportAssignmentSelect) providing evidential support to a Justification. The meaning of the assignment can be specified using the ClassifiedAs attribute inherited from the AssignmentObject.&lt;note&gt;The support item can be the results from an analysis, a report, or professional judgement.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
