        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491285002_976042_89824"/>
        <body>This capability is for the life-cycle management of the attachment of parts in specific positions of parent products. &lt;br/&gt;The figure below provides an overview of the capability. &lt;figuresysml&gt;&lt;id&gt;_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491292768_422721_97774&lt;/id&gt;Block Definition Diagram of the Slot CTC&lt;/figuresysml&gt;</body>
