        <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491292894_321917_97840" xmi:uuid="01bb32c3-83b2-4953-b449-2638b9a2f5ad" xmi:type="uml:Class">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491359158_996654_141414" xmi:uuid="baf5aa11-ede5-4e10-aa4c-e53efc1c8e0d" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491292894_321917_97840"/>
            <body>A SlotOn is an association between an item and a Slot that is a location on the item at which to install removable parts. &lt;example&gt;An aircraft has a pylon mounting on a wing as a location at which to install various equipment. An instance of the SlotOn entity data type identifies which attachment slot corresponds to the pylon.&lt;/example&gt; </body>
          </ownedComment>
          <name>SlotOn</name>
