            <body>A SlotVersion is an identification of a version of a Slot. &lt;note&gt;This is a generic concept of version, in most situations it is possible and more specific to represent a version of a Slot as SlotDesign, SlotAsPlanned or SlotAsRealized.&lt;/note&gt; </body>
