        <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491292914_570736_97843" xmi:uuid="6c9f13d1-9003-4e93-87f0-b99b2ac3f841" xmi:type="uml:Class">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491359443_398267_141559" xmi:uuid="c6db3503-3b90-43fb-ad4c-13c0a1ddaa56" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491292914_570736_97843"/>
            <body>A SlotAsRealized is a specialization of SlotVersion that identifies an individual that is a realized Slot. &lt;example&gt; FlyFasterWithUs Group operates an aircraft with serial number 1234 next year. The company records which individual engines power the aircraft at different times during the lifetime of the aircraft.&lt;/example&gt; </body>
          </ownedComment>
          <name>SlotAsRealized</name>
