            <body>A SlotDesignToRealized is a relationship between a design version of a Slot and a realized individual that conforms to the design. &lt;example&gt;WeMakeBigPlanes Limited builds aircraft serial number 1234 with a starboard engine attachment slot that conforms to design version 1.34.&lt;/example&gt;</body>
