            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491292946_309284_97858"/>
            <body>A SlotDesignToPlanned is a relationship between a design version of a Slot and a planned individual that conforms to the design. &lt;example&gt;WeMakeBigPlanes Limited plans production of aircraft serial number 1234 with a starboard engine attachment slot that is to conform to design version 1.34.&lt;/example&gt; </body>
