            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491288062_66557_93345"/>
            <body>An InterfaceSpecificationView provides a view of an InterfaceSpecification. &lt;example&gt;When developing a BSI standard for connecting domestic electrical equipment to the electricity supply, collected comments from experts form a new view on a version of the standard.&lt;/example&gt; </body>
          </ownedComment>
