              <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491317791_208182_119181"/>
              <body> the object or set of objects external to the exchange file for which this object is a proxy. This information is defined by reference data. The ReferenceData tab provides definitions of the Reference Data currently standardized for InterfaceDefinitionFor. The value of this attribute need not be specified.</body>
