        <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491287987_152797_93337" xmi:uuid="4daed84a-f2c1-4a55-bc40-10afd6fe7e5e" xmi:type="uml:Class">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491316848_476206_118652" xmi:uuid="6bb255f9-536e-48ee-8bb2-a6c6145dc2c4" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491287987_152797_93337"/>
            <body>An InterfaceConnectorView identifies a view of an InterfaceConnectorVersion. &lt;example&gt;A reliability engineer assesses the likely failure modes of design version 3.8 for the connector between a brake unit and the hydraulic control system. The engineer generates a set of data that is a specific view of the connector. An instance of the InterfaceConnectorView entity data type collects these data together.&lt;/example&gt; </body>
          </ownedComment>
          <name>InterfaceConnectorView</name>
