          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491317071_182103_118786" xmi:uuid="3dccd4f8-879c-4ee5-8d14-ab223e4990e4" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491288002_377527_93338"/>
            <body>An InterfaceConnectorOccurrence is an occurrence of an InterfaceConnectorView. The InterfaceConnectorOccurrence represents the place where a product used in an assembly can interact with other products in the assembly. The interaction is represented by an InterfaceConnection. </body>
          </ownedComment>
