    <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491284991_968562_89804" xmi:uuid="de38ed24-20d5-4c77-8d0a-7fd75080f5d7" xmi:type="uml:Package">
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491285008_426103_89832" xmi:uuid="529ffa95-26e6-40e0-a6e0-8c26be41103c" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491284991_968562_89804"/>
        <body>The Activity capability represents information concerning the management of activities. The capability allows the representation of activities and their associated methods. &lt;br/&gt;The figure below provides an overview of the capability. &lt;figuresysml&gt;&lt;id&gt;_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491285129_333531_89919&lt;/id&gt;Block Definition Diagram of the Activity CTC&lt;/figuresysml&gt;</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>Activity</name>
      <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491285004_9342_89829" xmi:uuid="3ea03ac5-6979-4952-9092-d3bbbbef512e" xmi:type="uml:Package">
