        <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491285379_768192_89987" xmi:uuid="072fda1e-ba4a-4f96-ac63-c3f44890052c" xmi:type="uml:Class">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491294133_355890_98890" xmi:uuid="de63e965-8e8c-46d0-9b16-ede25d872cbf" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491285379_768192_89987"/>
            <body>An ActivityAssignment is an assignment of an Activity to an item (specified by ActivityAssignmentSelect). It characterizes the role of the related data with respect to the activity. ActivityAssignment should not be used to represent the association of an activity with the people or organizations that are responsible for its execution or its management. That kind of information should be represented by instances of PersonOrganizationAssignment.</body>
          </ownedComment>
