        <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491285395_395212_89992" xmi:uuid="285c878b-8780-4fc0-80ed-aabe5970cf26" xmi:type="uml:Class">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491294565_788560_99424" xmi:uuid="661ac374-2e78-45ad-bfca-e9a0be6bd222" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491285395_395212_89992"/>
            <body>An ActualActivity is a type of Activity that is a record of the occurrence of an Activity taking place. The ActualActivity can be related through an ActivityHappeningRelationship to the PlannedActivity of which it is an occurrence. The existence of an ActualActivity instance means that the ActualActivity has commenced. &lt;example&gt;The replacement of the tyres of my bicycle, frame number ZH002342, on October 25, 2011.&lt;/example&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <name>ActualActivity</name>
          <generalization xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491293841_595889_98513" xmi:uuid="479acb87-5cf9-45f1-a733-30c50a2e4a22" xmi:type="uml:Generalization">
            <general xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491285371_595111_89984"/>
          </generalization>
          <generalization xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491294521_584181_99367" xmi:uuid="6f68374e-cb12-4ebd-bb5d-b72078230f93" xmi:type="uml:Generalization">
