        <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491285371_595111_89984" xmi:uuid="9f2ba627-2bf3-4f8f-a1ae-1d4460d219b6" xmi:type="uml:Class">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491293960_608541_98648" xmi:uuid="74567eec-43fb-4eee-8e9b-e40f7729db0b" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491285371_595111_89984"/>
            <body>An Activity represents an occurrence of an action that has taken place, is taking place, or is expected to take place in the future. The mechanism by which the Activity is performed is identified by an ActivityMethod that is referred to by the ChosenMethod property. &lt;example&gt;Change, distilling, design, a process to drill a hole, and a task such as training someone, are examples of activities.&lt;/example&gt; &lt;note&gt;The items that are affected by an Activity are identified by instances of ActivityAssignment.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <name>Activity</name>
          <generalization xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491293840_138557_98487" xmi:uuid="06ec3b85-4abc-42f5-8622-23972a6acd9f" xmi:type="uml:Generalization">
