            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491285382_540150_89988"/>
            <body>An ActivityMethod is a way to carry out an Activity. &lt;note&gt;There can be more than one method for producing a required result.&lt;/note&gt; &lt;note&gt;This definition can be used to characterize a way to resolve a request for action.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
