            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491285370_153680_89983"/>
            <body>An ActivityHappeningRelationship is a type of ActivityRelationship that relates a PlannedActivity and its ActualActivity. &lt;note&gt;Many ActualActivity objects can be the actual for a single PlannedActivity.&lt;/note&gt; &lt;example&gt;A single defined activity is recorded historically by several sub-activities.&lt;/example&gt; &lt;note&gt;A single ActualActivity can fulfil several PlannedActivity objects.&lt;/note&gt; &lt;example&gt;A single servicing activity takes the opportunity to make additional checks and repairs.&lt;/example&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <name>ActivityHappeningRelationship</name>
          <generalization xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491293809_277355_98453" xmi:uuid="9ea64241-0291-43e1-b5b5-bcf5c039115a" xmi:type="uml:Generalization">
