        <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491290323_455612_95614" xmi:uuid="d65533c9-2704-4f75-836e-cf26c6c555c4" xmi:type="uml:Class">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491335972_527180_130089" xmi:uuid="62b11bd6-49c1-4a6d-a604-6367fb9d3f20" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491290323_455612_95614"/>
            <body>A ProbabilityDistribution is a specialization of ValueWithUnit that represents an assignment of probabilities (or probability densities in the case of continuous random variables) to all possible outcomes of a random variable.</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <name>ProbabilityDistribution</name>
          <generalization xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491311282_934304_114662" xmi:uuid="d9812eda-59ea-4b3a-98c4-93efcf01b116" xmi:type="uml:Generalization">
            <general xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491287358_768221_92668"/>
          </generalization>
          <isAbstract>true</isAbstract>
          <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491335978_405656_130092" xmi:uuid="7c87e9f0-bf75-4e50-8cfd-79b34d857cbe" xmi:type="uml:Property">
            <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491417107_367815_186935" xmi:uuid="90eaa968-1387-47ff-9cef-9040c989f9b7" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
              <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491335978_405656_130092"/>
              <body> the identifier or set of identifiers for the ProbabilityDistribution. The value of this attribute need not be specified. &lt;note&gt; This attribute supports multi-identification in different contexts as described in Fundamental concepts and assumptions.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
            </ownedComment>
            <name>Id</name>
            <visibility>public</visibility>
            <type xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491286859_178560_92123"/>
            <lowerValue xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491417107_10803_186936" xmi:uuid="afccfab7-4a18-4994-8407-469cf99b9480" xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger"/>
            <upperValue xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491417106_978191_186934" xmi:uuid="52c65d2f-11bb-49e4-8f1e-ef8f5b1876bd" xmi:type="uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural">
              <value>*</value>
            </upperValue>
            <aggregation>composite</aggregation>
            <association xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491290330_955968_95621"/>
          </ownedAttribute>
          <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491335986_923670_130096" xmi:uuid="eb9677b3-cd76-4fbf-8503-c263447fa88a" xmi:type="uml:Property">
            <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491417110_431685_186946" xmi:uuid="128c29ba-fb4c-4564-a1bf-0ff3448c19ef" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
              <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491335986_923670_130096"/>
              <body>the expectation E(x), which is the "summation" of x.p(x) over all x, where x is the random variable, and p(x) is the probability of its occurrence. The term "summation" covers both literal summation in the case of a discrete distribution, and integration for a continuous distribution. </body>
            </ownedComment>
            <name>Mean</name>
            <visibility>public</visibility>
            <type href="../../../DataTypes.xmi#REAL"/>
            <aggregation>composite</aggregation>
          </ownedAttribute>
          <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491335989_681710_130097" xmi:uuid="783423aa-8c55-45cb-86f9-8d7b34472da9" xmi:type="uml:Property">
            <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491417112_47564_186950" xmi:uuid="89afd690-6e2e-419a-baf7-1347785e50aa" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
              <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491335989_681710_130097"/>
              <body>the real number indicating the square of the standard deviation of the probability distribution. </body>
            </ownedComment>
            <name>Variance</name>
            <visibility>public</visibility>
            <type href="../../../DataTypes.xmi#REAL"/>
            <aggregation>composite</aggregation>
          </ownedAttribute>
          <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491335992_910450_130098" xmi:uuid="a844ffc7-ee41-4423-8949-cfe0358213a6" xmi:type="uml:Property">
            <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491417113_665506_186954" xmi:uuid="f4edf033-43b3-4cfa-97b4-297237a67e4a" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
              <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491335992_910450_130098"/>
              <body>the indication whether the domain of the probability distribution is continuous (value equal 'TRUE') or discrete (value equal 'FALSE'). &lt;example&gt;The measurement of a person's height is a continuous distribution, since it can take any value between 0 and 3m.&lt;/example&gt; &lt;example&gt;Coin tossing gives rise to a discrete distribution, since the number of heads cannot be a fraction.&lt;/example&gt;</body>
            </ownedComment>
            <name>IsContinuous</name>
            <visibility>public</visibility>
            <type href="../../../DataTypes.xmi#BOOLEAN"/>
            <aggregation>composite</aggregation>
          </ownedAttribute>
          <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677509421753_303029_74398" xmi:uuid="292297f0-72e0-42d0-880a-e46bcfc963da" xmi:type="uml:Port">
