            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491287500_354838_92837"/>
            <body>A DigitalDocumentDefinition is a type of DocumentDefinition that collects files that are archived on an optical computer disc, magnetic, electronic storage, or a combination thereof. A DigitalDocumentDefinition can consist of one or many component DigitalFile.</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <name>DigitalDocumentDefinition</name>
          <generalization xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491312093_842598_115209" xmi:uuid="4f2b78bd-7866-48d8-8ea4-50ff82ded5c4" xmi:type="uml:Generalization">
