              <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491312121_847318_115236"/>
              <body> the computer interpretable realization (via DigitalFile), or set of computer interpretable realizations, of the DigitalDocumentDefinition. The value of this attribute need not be specified.</body>
            </ownedComment>
