          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491313438_255428_116304" xmi:uuid="978b12e0-5a81-4aaf-8fc7-608769766361" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491287573_649093_92848"/>
            <body>A DocumentDefinition is one of potentially more alternative views of a DocumentVersion. &lt;note&gt;A DocumentVersion can have more than one view.&lt;/note&gt;&lt;example&gt;A version of a logical document, which contains a shape model, can be represented in the different native formats of two three-dimensional CAD systems.&lt;/example&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
