              <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491313789_703488_116569"/>
              <body> the word or group of words that convey the subject or sub contents of the Document. &lt;note&gt;This attribute supports multiple DocumentPortions in different contexts as well as multi-linguism.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
