            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_65b021e_1677491287526_132232_92843"/>
            <body>A Hardcopy is a type of File that is the actual physical object representing a DocumentVersion. It could be a stack of paper consisting of one or more sheets, on which some product data is written, printed or plotted.</body>
